	<Notes name="Notes">
		<Note text_size_multiplier="2" text_color_index="4" text="EarthSearch EP01. PLAY (n91) starts BOTH masters at 00:00. STOP ALL CLIPS (n81) stops and resets both. Cue Level knob to zero is CLEAN / ALL FX OFF. The 5x8 pad grid addresses the five generative overlay layers only - no pad can touch either master. FFT is Composition FFT, so it follows the programme audio in the masters with no routing." />
	</Notes>
</Composition>
